{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7e2f7e84-348c-8c0b-b875-49fc05f5fa4c",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T12:58:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Peter Gifford",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:56:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City of Newport Finance Department, Janet Whitcomb speaking. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:56:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. Is it all right if I ask about a parking ticket? My name is Peter Gifford."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:56:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Mr. Gifford. Do you have the ticket in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:56:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do. Is it all right if I read the number to you? It says 4-4-7-1-9-3."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:56:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Give me a moment to pull that up. [pause] I have it. Issued this morning on Washington Street for no resident permit displayed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:57:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's the thing. I do have the sticker. It's on the windshield, lower corner on the passenger side. I park in front of my building at 469 Washington Street, down in the Point. I'm the landlord there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:57:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Was the sticker visible this morning? With the snow and the rain, sometimes the officer can't see it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:57:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It might have had some slush on the glass, I couldn't say. Is it all right if I ask whether a first ticket can be waived? I've never had one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:57:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The fine is due as written unless it's appealed. You can request a review by submitting the ticket with a copy of your registration and a photo of the sticker on the windshield. The review decides whether it's dismissed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:57:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. And what is the fine on it, if I may ask? I thought you said forty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:57:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I didn't give an amount, sir. The amount is printed on the ticket. Look near the bottom, right of the violation code."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:58:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Here. Yes, it says thirty. Could you repeat the ticket number you read back, please? I heard a 9 where I have a 3."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:58:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly. The number I have is 4-4-7-1-9-3. Ends in a 3."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:58:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that matches mine. Is it all right if I bring the photo to the window tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:58:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the window at City Hall is open during business hours. Bring the ticket, registration, and the photo."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:58:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. That's all I needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:58:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Gifford. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
